  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "Suppose $f(x,y,z)=e^{x}(y+z)$. Suppose that $x, y,$ and $z$ are each functions of the variables $s$ and $t$ with the following values when $s=0$ and $t=0$:\n\n$x=0,              y=1,            z=2,                 \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial t}=2,                \\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial t}=3,                   \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial t}=4$.\n\nFind $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial t}$ at $s=0$ and $t=0$.",
